[
    {
        "content": "<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"433x244\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/c80R5rg6Fw09VEgVyLs9HB3b/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/c80R5rg6Fw09VEgVyLs9HB3b/image.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\nHi, got this error today and I can't tell where the rewrite tactic is failing; how do you go about figuring that out? And how does one fix such an error? The expressions are similar enough that it looks like there should be a simple fix, right?</p>",
        "id": 612154122,
        "sender_full_name": "Xime",
        "timestamp": 1784731825
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Can you post a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mwe.html\">#mwe</a>? Also, if you provide explicit arguments to the theorem you are using within the <code>rewrite</code> tactic, you will get a better (more specific) error</p>",
        "id": 612156857,
