    {
        "content": "<p>the type of <code>Finset.univ</code> is</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: Finset.univ.{u_1} {α : Type u_1} [Fintype α] : Finset α -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">univ</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>so Lean still have to guess what the <code>α</code> is supposed to be here</p>",
        "id": 612170497,
